# 4. Confluence Access

The Requirement Intake Specialist reads the PRD using the existing Confluence MCP.

The specialist receives something like:

PRD URL
or
Confluence page reference

The MCP layer should be wrapped behind our own adapter.

Example:

class ConfluenceService:
    async def get_page(...):
        ...

Do not spread MCP-specific response structures throughout the codebase.

Convert MCP results into internal domain models.

The rest of the application must not care whether the requirement came from:

- Confluence MCP
- future Jira requirement
- uploaded document
- another source

Create an abstraction that makes this extensible.

