# 9. Revision Loop

Implement the revision loop using LangGraph.

Pseudo-flow:

generate_tests
    ↓
validate_tests
    ↓
if PASS:
    persist_validated_tests

if REVISE:
    increment revision
    send validator feedback to generator
    generate again
    validate again

if NEED_HUMAN_REVIEW:
    stop/pause workflow

Add configuration:

MAX_TEST_GENERATION_REVISIONS

Suggested default:

3

If maximum revisions are reached:

status = NEED_HUMAN_REVIEW

Do not create an infinite agent loop.

