# 13. Persistence Pattern

Persist after each important boundary.

Recommended checkpoints:

1. PRD retrieved
2. requirement analysis completed
3. test suite generated
4. validation completed
5. revision generated
6. final suite validated

This lets the workflow be debugged and later resumed.

