# 25. Definition of Done

The implementation is complete when:

1. A user can submit a Confluence PRD reference.
2. The PRD is retrieved through the Confluence MCP adapter.
3. Requirement Analysis returns a validated Pydantic model.
4. Tests are generated as structured Pydantic TestCase objects.
5. A separate Coverage Validation Specialist reviews them.
6. Missing coverage causes an automatic revision loop.
7. PASS ends the loop.
8. The loop has a hard maximum revision count.
9. Results are stored in MongoDB.
10. Workflow state can be queried.
11. Agent/model/tool calls are logged.
12. All deterministic routing has unit tests.
13. At least one full mocked end-to-end workflow test passes.
14. The code is modular enough to later mount this workflow as a subgraph inside the complete QA Agentic Platform.

